            B.q("ai-m3-13", "ai-container-troubleshoot", "What is the likely cause, and the fix?", listOf("The Service has no endpoints; fix its selector so it matches the quotes pods' labels", "ClusterIP Services only serve their own namespace; change quotes to type LoadBalancer", "Short names resolve only in the caller's own namespace; call quotes.pricing instead", "The pods bypass cluster DNS; set dnsPolicy to ClusterFirst and keep calling http://quotes"), setOf(2), "Cluster DNS names each Service service.namespace.svc.cluster.local. From the same namespace the short name works; from another namespace you add the namespace (quotes.pricing, or quotes.pricing.svc.cluster.local). A temporary debug pod (kubectl run with an image that has nslookup or curl) is a quick way to test such names.",
