            B.q("ai-m3-20", "ai-cosmos-vector", "Every vector search filters by the learner's partition key first, which leaves at most a few thousand vectors per search, and embeddings have 1,536 dimensions. Which vector index type does Microsoft recommend here?", listOf("flat", "quantizedFlat", "diskANN", "A composite index on /embedding"), setOf(1), "quantizedFlat compresses vectors and searches them by brute force; it is recommended when the vectors in scope of a search are about 50,000 or fewer, for example when filters or the partition key narrow the search. It supports up to 4,096 dimensions.",
