            B.q("ai-m3-22", "ai-cosmos-changefeed", "A processor has run for weeks. The team now sets its start time to the beginning to re-embed all old items, redeploys, and nothing old is processed. Why?", listOf("The start setting applies only when no leases exist; otherwise the processor resumes from its leases", "The change feed keeps only a short retention window, so the old changes have aged out", "Starting from the beginning is supported only in all versions and deletes mode, not latest version", "The monitored container must be recreated before its feed can restart from the beginning"), setOf(0), "The start setting tells a brand-new processor where to begin. Once leases (saved bookmarks) exist, the processor always continues from them. To replay, use a new processor name or new lease container (or a new lease prefix with the Functions trigger).",
