            B.q("ai-m3-35", "ai-servicebus", "The API only sends messages to the queue, and the worker only reads them. Which role assignments follow least privilege? Select two.", listOf("Azure Service Bus Data Owner for both identities", "Contributor on the namespace for the worker", "Azure Service Bus Data Sender for the API's managed identity", "Azure Service Bus Data Receiver for the worker's managed identity"), setOf(2, 3), "Service Bus has data roles split by job: Data Sender can only send, Data Receiver can only receive. Giving each identity just the one it needs is least privilege.",
